  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For the past three days, I've been having a completely random issue where game invites wouldn't show up in the game, but rather, they'd only show up on the website. The issue seems to be completely random, like one day, everything's working perfectly fine, but then the next day, I'd run into this bug. Today was extremely awkward, as I found that the invites were only showing up on my iPad via Firefox for iOS, and not on any of my desktop web browsers (tested both Firefox and Google Chrome), and I was also unable to see the invites in-game.\n\nI hope a fix for this issue can be found soon.",
